    "long_instructions": "## Making Parts Interactive\r\n\r\n:::details [**1. Explore the page**]\r\n\r\n- Try the buttons and inputs to see what happens.\r\n- Discuss with your partner:\r\n  - What do you notice?\r\n  - What works?\r\n  - What do NOT work?\r\n:::\r\n\r\n:::details [**2. Look for parts**]\r\n\r\n- With your partner, list as many elements (parts of the page) as you can in your activity guide.\r\n- Which of these could change?\r\n:::\r\n\r\n:::details [**3. Choose one interaction**]\r\n\r\n- Pick **ONE button or input** you want to make work.\r\n- Have AI Tutor make it work.\r\n  - Tell the AI to **update the code to make the \"[button/input name\" work**.\r\n      - Describe:\r\n          - What the user does (click, type, etc)\r\n          - What should change on the page\r\n- Test the interaction. Does it work the way you expected?\r\n:::",
    "name_suffix": "_2026",
